    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/f57fe75369d95364bfc25ff9eb13f3b2.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><br>If you've ever dreamed of taking on your school teacher with your water gun, After School is for you! Play as a child in his playground in this dynamic third-person shooter!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/0bec98f0a46dec8c0923f6c2ec5bdba4.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/58ff0b676b528f1063ed59df4abca8d2.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Confront numerous enemies with different behaviors!<br></li><li> Collect cardboard boxes and craft powerful objects to survive the nightmare waves!<br></li><li> Achieve the highest possible scores and beat the strongest competitors!<br></li><li> Manage your water to survive as long as possible!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/4608f1262033b88c04cfd476c8fb71f8.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/452e1e3edfb870916da91359c1563136.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/ddb761f8dced45bf7c594ecef4cff781.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br>This game was made as part of the <strong>Ubisoft 2023 university contest</strong>. It was made in 10 weeks with the <strong>Arcade</strong> theme. <br>Thanks to our friends and family for playtesting and supporting us in this huge project! Also, a special thanks to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> eSPACE for playtesting our game<br></li><li> Centre Libourne kindergarden and the kids who made amazing drawings<br></li><li> Ubisoft for organizing this contest</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/d224bdbe708be24ba1cb49239e8c6f45.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br>To enjoy After School, it's important to play it with a controller.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/7141f353665b790fcc0be831a809c941.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/f57fe75369d95364bfc25ff9eb13f3b2.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><br>If you've ever dreamed of taking on your school teacher with your water gun, After School is for you! Play as a child in his playground in this dynamic third-person shooter!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/0bec98f0a46dec8c0923f6c2ec5bdba4.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/58ff0b676b528f1063ed59df4abca8d2.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Confront numerous enemies with different behaviors!<br></li><li> Collect cardboard boxes and craft powerful objects to survive the nightmare waves!<br></li><li> Achieve the highest possible scores and beat the strongest competitors!<br></li><li> Manage your water to survive as long as possible!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/4608f1262033b88c04cfd476c8fb71f8.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/452e1e3edfb870916da91359c1563136.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/ddb761f8dced45bf7c594ecef4cff781.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br>This game was made as part of the <strong>Ubisoft 2023 university contest</strong>. It was made in 10 weeks with the <strong>Arcade</strong> theme. <br>Thanks to our friends and family for playtesting and supporting us in this huge project! Also, a special thanks to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> eSPACE for playtesting our game<br></li><li> Centre Libourne kindergarden and the kids who made amazing drawings<br></li><li> Ubisoft for organizing this contest</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/d224bdbe708be24ba1cb49239e8c6f45.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span><br><br>To enjoy After School, it's important to play it with a controller.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2455940/extras/7141f353665b790fcc0be831a809c941.avif?t=1687616017\" /></span>",
